## Bundled skill content — OpenDesign

`dsh-open-design/skills/` contains 51 skill bundles copied verbatim from
**OpenDesign** (https://github.com/nexu-io/open-design), plus one bundle that is
original to this repository (see below).

- Upstream licence: **Apache-2.0** — full text in [`LICENSE`](LICENSE).
- The exact upstream revision is recorded in
  [`dsh-open-design/PROVENANCE.md`](dsh-open-design/PROVENANCE.md) (ref + tree
  SHA + fetch timestamp).
- Only text resources were copied (`.md .html .css .js .mjs .json .txt .yaml
  .yml .svg`). Upstream preview images and example binaries are omitted.
- The **only** upstream modification is that a skill whose frontmatter `name`
  was missing or not kebab-case has that field rewritten to match its directory
  name, because DeepSeek Harness rejects such a skill outright. 9 files were
  affected. Skill bodies are otherwise untouched.

