## Original to this repository

- `dsh-open-design/skills/open-design/` — the router skill (workflow, design
  system bridge, P0 gate guidance, and field notes measured on a real install).
- `dsh-open-design/cordis.patch.yml`, `dsh-open-design/lib/index.js`,
