These are licensed under Apache-2.0, same as the repository.

## Not included on purpose

`examples-web-prototype/assets/` is **empty in the repository**. The example
page's photographs are the property of the institution they depict and are
excluded from redistribution. `examples-web-prototype/assets.json` records where
each one came from; fetch them locally with `tools/od-fetch-assets.mjs`.

